2
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:02,300
路地裏の真ん中で 慣れない景色と
In the middle of a back alley, with unfamiliar scenery

3
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:07,100
好きじゃない匂いに 私は覆われて 染まっていくんでしょう
and a scent I don't like covering me, I guess I'm being tainted.

4
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:24,600
私は怖がりで 知らないことには手を出さず 誰かがやってきて 毒味をするまで待っていた
I'm a coward who wouldn't touch anything unfamiliar, waiting until someone came along to test for poison.

5
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:32,400
することは単純で マニュアル通りの生活を 来る日も淡々と過ごしていた
What I had to do was simple: living a manual-like life, spending day after day indifferently.

6
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:42,500
そういやさ そういやさ 昨日の私もこうだった そういやさ そういやさ
Come to think of it, come to think of it, yesterday's me was just like this. Come to think of it, come to think of it,

7
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:46,800
弱い音を吐いてる 薄っぺらい人間です
I'm a shallow person who spits out weak complaints.

8
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:51,300
一歩前に出るのはやめておきます 絡まれたくはないからさ
I'll refrain from stepping forward, because I don't want to get involved.

9
00:02:51,300 --> 00:03:00,000
描いた理想像に現実味がないから 近づけないよう生きておきます 明日も同じよう過ごしておきます
Since my ideal image lacks reality, I'll live keeping my distance, and pass tomorrow the same way.

10
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:17,800
路地裏の真ん中で いつもの夕日を薄目で眺めて 胸の内で呟いた 「いつまで続くだろう」
In the middle of a back alley, squinting at the usual sunset, I whispered in my heart, "How long will this go on?"

11
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:26,500
そういやさ そういやさ 昨日も夕飯これだった そういやさ そういやさ
Come to think of it, come to think of it, yesterday's dinner was this too. Come to think of it, come to think of it,

12
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:31,000
臆病で切りが悪い 意気地無し人間です
I'm a timid, indecisive, cowardly human being.

13
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:35,500
一歩後ろに下がって逃げておきます 目立ちたくなんかはないからさ
I'll step back and run away, because I don't want to stand out.

14
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:44,800
描いた理想像に現実味がないから 近づけないよう生きておきます 明日も同じよう過ごしておきます
Since my ideal image lacks reality, I'll live keeping my distance, and pass tomorrow the same way.

15
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:13,500
弱い音を吐いてる 薄っぺらい人間です 一歩前に出るのはやめておきます 絡まれたくはないからさ
I'm a shallow person who spits out weak complaints. I'll refrain from stepping forward, because I don't want to get involved.

16
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:23,500
ため息ばっかでさ 吸う息足りないの きっとそう上手くはいかないけどさ 試しにちゃんと生きてみよう
I'm always sighing, not getting enough breath. It probably won't go so well, but as a test, let's try to live properly.

17
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:57,600
鉄の弾が 正義の証明 貫けば 英雄に近づいた
An iron bullet is proof of justice. Whenever it pierces, I become closer to a hero.

18
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,000
その目を閉じて
Close your eyes...

19
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:01,708
同じ形
...the same shape...

20
00:05:01,708 --> 00:05:05,208
同じ体温の悪魔
a demon with the same body temperature.

21
00:05:05,808 --> 00:05:08,408
僕はダメであいつがいいの？
Am I no good, but he's alright?

22
00:05:08,408 --> 00:05:11,008
そこに壁があっただけなのに
There was just a wall there, and yet...

23
00:05:11,008 --> 00:05:13,708
生まれてしまった 運命嘆くな
Don't lament the fate of being born.

24
00:05:13,708 --> 00:05:17,008
僕らはみんな 自由なんだから
Because all of us are free.

25
00:05:17,308 --> 00:05:22,508
鳥のように 羽があれば
If I had wings like a bird,

26
00:05:22,508 --> 00:05:28,008
どこへだって 行けるけど
I could go anywhere, but...

27
00:05:28,008 --> 00:05:33,208
帰る場所が なければ
if I have no place to return to,

28
00:05:33,208 --> 00:05:38,008
きっとどこへも 行けない
I surely can't go anywhere.

29
00:05:38,008 --> 00:05:43,008
ただただ生きるの は嫌だ
I just hate living like this.

30
00:05:43,008 --> 00:05:48,808
世界は残酷だ
The world is cruel,

31
00:05:48,808 --> 00:05:54,008
それでも君を愛すよ
but even so, I will love you.

32
00:05:54,008 --> 00:05:59,008
なにを犠牲にしても
No matter what I sacrifice,

33
00:05:59,008 --> 00:06:04,208
それでも君を守るよ
even so, I will protect you.

34
00:06:04,208 --> 00:06:09,008
間違いだとしても 疑ったりしない
Even if it's wrong, I won't doubt it.

35
00:06:09,008 --> 00:06:14,708
正しさとは 自分のこと 強く信じることだ
Righteousness means strongly believing in yourself.

36
00:06:23,808 --> 00:06:29,808
鉄の雨が 降り散る情景 テレビの中 映画に見えたんだ
The scene of falling iron rain looked like a movie on TV.

37
00:06:29,808 --> 00:06:34,908
戦争なんて 愚かな凶暴 関係ない 知らない国の話
War is foolish violence, an story of an unrelated, unknown country.

38
00:06:34,908 --> 00:06:40,008
それならなんで あいつ憎んで 黒い気持ち 隠しきれない理由
Then why do I hate them? The reason I can't hide these dark feelings,

39
00:06:40,008 --> 00:06:48,808
説明だって できやしないんだ 僕らはなんて 矛盾ばっかなんだ
I can't even explain it. How full of contradictions we are!

40
00:07:08,008 --> 00:07:18,508
この言葉も 訳されれば 本当の意味は 伝わらない
If these words are translated, their true meaning won't be understood.

41
00:07:18,508 --> 00:07:27,708
信じるのは その目を開いて 触れた世界だけ
What I believe in is only the world I touch with my eyes open.

42
00:07:28,008 --> 00:07:35,008
ただただ生きるの は嫌だ
I just hate living like this.

43
00:07:35,508 --> 00:07:41,508
世界は残酷だ
The world is cruel,

44
00:07:41,508 --> 00:07:47,508
それでも君を愛すよ
but even so, I will love you.

45
00:07:47,508 --> 00:07:52,508
なにを犠牲にしても
No matter what I sacrifice,

46
00:07:52,508 --> 00:07:57,808
それでも君を守るよ
even so, I will protect you.

47
00:07:57,808 --> 00:08:02,808
選んだ人の影 捨てたものの屍
The shadow of the chosen, the corpses of what was discarded,

48
00:08:02,808 --> 00:08:08,008
気づいたんだ 自分の中 育つのは悪魔の子
I realized that what grows inside me is a child of the devil.

49
00:08:08,008 --> 00:08:15,508
正義の裏 犠牲の中 心には悪魔の子
Behind justice, amidst sacrifice, in my heart is a child of the devil.

50
00:08:42,508 --> 00:08:47,508
そっと振り返った軌跡 どうしたって光って
The path I gently looked back on shines no matter what.

51
00:08:47,508 --> 00:08:52,808
ありふれた君が いつだってスーパーヒーロー
An ordinary you was always a superhero.

52
00:09:01,008 --> 00:09:06,008
いつもポンコツだった私 飛べなくて未完成
I was always clumsy, unable to fly, incomplete.

53
00:09:06,008 --> 00:09:11,208
アヒルの子はアヒルのままかもね なんてさ
"Maybe the duckling stays a duckling," or so I said.

54
00:09:11,208 --> 00:09:16,208
らしさなんてほっといて 君となんかちょっと似ていて
Leaving "being oneself" aside, I'm somewhat like you.

55
00:09:16,208 --> 00:09:21,508
デコボコだからジャストに 噛み合うパズルピース
Because we're uneven, we fit together perfectly like puzzle pieces.

56
00:09:21,508 --> 00:09:26,808
繋ぎたい 繋ぎたい 届かない言葉も
I want to connect, I want to connect, even the words that don't reach.

57
00:09:26,808 --> 00:09:31,808
いつかは誰かの何かになりたいから
Because someday I want to become something to someone.

58
00:09:31,808 --> 00:09:41,008
Crazy no lazy 夢の中 夢を見せて
Crazy, no lazy, show me a dream within a dream.

59
00:09:41,008 --> 00:09:46,808
Always going 何千回 何万回 膝をついても
Always going, no matter how many thousands or tens of thousands of times I drop to my knees,

60
00:09:46,808 --> 00:09:52,008
最大級 i love you で立ち上がれるから
I can stand back up with the ultimate "I love you".

61
00:09:52,008 --> 00:09:58,008
とびっきりオーバーな ty
An extraordinarily over-the-top Thank You.

62
00:09:58,008 --> 00:10:00,008
消えそうなハッピーも 勇気も
The fading happiness and courage...

63
00:10:00,316 --> 00:10:03,416
無理しまっちゃって 大失敗も
Overexerting myself and failing big time,

64
00:10:03,516 --> 00:10:07,416
後悔すら愛せるなら
if I can learn to love even my regrets,

65
00:10:07,816 --> 00:10:14,016
背中には君という羽
then on my back are wings called "you."

66
00:10:21,216 --> 00:10:26,016
チクタク追いこして 積もった乾いた寂しさ
Overtaking tick-tock, dry loneliness accumulated,

67
00:10:26,016 --> 00:10:30,016
隣で走る君と Release, release
running beside you, release, release,

68
00:10:30,016 --> 00:10:33,516
レリーズしたり
release it all...

69
00:10:41,816 --> 00:10:46,716
君の色が 私を塗り替えて
Your color repaints who I am,

70
00:10:46,716 --> 00:10:52,016
壊れかけの 音で響くから
echoing with a broken sound...

71
00:10:52,516 --> 00:10:57,616
おとぎ話の 続きをまだ描きたいんだよ
I still want to paint the continuation of this fairy tale.

72
00:10:57,616 --> 00:11:03,516
パレット パレット 連れて行くよ
Palette, palette, I'll take you along!

73
00:11:04,416 --> 00:11:08,516
きっと難解 案外 難解
Surely complex, unexpectedly complex, complex...

74
00:11:09,616 --> 00:11:13,816
きっと難解 案外 難解
Surely complex, unexpectedly complex, complex...

75
00:11:14,216 --> 00:11:16,016
Always going

76
00:11:16,016 --> 00:11:21,016
難解 案外 難解 迷い込んでも
Complex, unexpectedly complex, complex, even if we lose our way,

77
00:11:21,016 --> 00:11:25,816
最大級 I love you な君がいるから
because I have you, whom I love to the maximum degree,

78
00:11:25,816 --> 00:11:30,316
本気 Specialな Thank you
a truly special "Thank you."

79
00:11:30,316 --> 00:11:35,516
それでもってラッキーも 運命も引き寄せて
And with that, pulling in good luck and destiny,

80
00:11:35,516 --> 00:11:40,816
もうバイバイも 涙も忘れないよ
I won't forget goodbyes or tears anymore.

81
00:11:40,816 --> 00:11:46,016
飛べなかった わたしの
For me, who couldn't fly...

82
00:11:46,016 --> 00:11:52,016
この背中には 君という羽
on this back are wings called "you."

83
00:11:53,016 --> 00:12:07,516
Woah... Woah...

84
00:12:20,016 --> 00:12:25,316
描いた未来の 景色がここにある
The scenery of the future I envisioned is right here.

85
00:12:25,516 --> 00:12:30,616
弱さも抱きしめて行くんだから
Because I'll move forward, embracing even my weaknesses...

86
00:12:30,816 --> 00:12:36,016
広げた翼が 輝いていく
The spread wings begin to shine,

87
00:12:36,016 --> 00:12:40,016
飛び立って 明日へ
taking flight into tomorrow!

88
00:12:57,616 --> 00:13:00,616
等身大の私を映してたい
I want to reflect my true, authentic self.

89
00:13:01,016 --> 00:13:05,516
ただ 望む瞬間 衝動になってんだ
Just that desired moment is turning into an impulse.

90
00:13:05,816 --> 00:13:10,816
くだらないとさ 煙り切っていく
Cutting through the smoke of trivial things,

91
00:13:11,216 --> 00:13:16,016
目をそらして 可能性だって夢を見てみたいのに
turning my eyes away, even though I want to dream of possibilities...

92
00:13:16,516 --> 00:13:22,016
ずっとわかっていたんだけど 言葉は浮いてる対象に
I knew it all along, but words float toward their target,

93
00:13:22,016 --> 00:13:26,216
大げささって思ってるんでしょ
thinking it's an exaggeration, right?

94
00:13:26,216 --> 00:13:31,516
ずっと黙っていたんだけど 心ってやっぱ正直だ
I stayed silent all this time, but the heart is honest after all.

95
00:13:31,516 --> 00:13:37,016
閉じ込められたい場所 感じていたい
I want to feel the place where I want to be locked in.

96
00:13:37,016 --> 00:13:38,216
居場所
The place I belong...

97
00:13:38,816 --> 00:13:47,016
響かせて 掲げたカラーで 焦がしてよ 赤色になっていく
Let it resonate, with the colors held high, burn it up, turning into red...

98
00:13:47,016 --> 00:13:55,516
何度も 盗まれたって 取り返した意思の傷跡に
No matter how many times it's stolen, upon the scars of intent reclaimed,

99
00:13:55,516 --> 00:13:58,016
誓った
I swore...

100
00:14:06,616 --> 00:14:11,516
失敗 後悔は泣いて ため息の音がしてる
Failure and regret cry, making the sound of sighs.

101
00:14:11,816 --> 00:14:17,016
現状にそぐわない 飲み込んだ 言ってたんだ
Not matching reality, I swallowed it down, I kept saying...

102
00:14:17,016 --> 00:14:19,816
ああ 忘れないように
Ah, so I don't forget...

103
00:14:20,016 --> 00:14:25,516
降臨祭 もう汚されないように
Advent, so that it won't be stained anymore...

104
00:14:25,516 --> 00:14:30,816
もっと笑っていたいんだもの 大人になってくだいしょうに
Because I want to smile more, as a price for growing up...

105
00:14:31,016 --> 00:14:35,516
あなただってきっと思ってるんでしょ
You surely think so too, right?

106
00:14:35,516 --> 00:14:40,816
ちゃんとわかっていたんだけど 心ってやっぱ正直だ
I understood it well, but the heart is honest after all.

107
00:14:41,016 --> 00:14:46,516
失えなくなった痛みを 感じていたい
I want to feel the pain that I can no longer lose...

108
00:14:46,516 --> 00:14:55,016
暮らしたこの場所で 咲かせた手裏剣 焦がさないでよ
In this place where I lived, the blooming shuriken, don't scorch it,

109
00:14:55,016 --> 00:14:59,016
このまま話は終わっていく
is the story going to end just like this?

110
00:14:59,016 --> 00:15:01,016
何度も
Again and again...

111
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:02,824
取り戻した日々の傷痕に
On the scars of the days I reclaimed,

112
00:15:02,824 --> 00:15:05,524
誓った
I swore...

113
00:15:13,224 --> 00:15:19,024
ここだよ 響かせて
Right here, make it resound!

114
00:15:23,224 --> 00:15:29,524
心を響かせて
Make my heart resound...

115
00:15:30,824 --> 00:15:33,524
ずっと
Forever...

116
00:15:35,224 --> 00:15:37,524
ここだよ 響かせて
Right here, make it resound!

117
00:15:37,524 --> 00:15:40,024
掲げたこの腕
With this arm raised high,

118
00:15:40,024 --> 00:15:44,824
描いた未来で 賑やかになっていく
in the future I envisioned, it becomes vibrant.

119
00:15:45,224 --> 00:15:48,024
何度でも
Time and time again,

120
00:15:48,024 --> 00:15:53,024
盗まれて手放した 必死の傷痕に
on the frantic scars of what was stolen and released,

121
00:15:53,024 --> 00:15:55,524
誓った
I swore.

122
00:16:13,224 --> 00:16:15,224
はい！
Alright!

123
00:16:16,024 --> 00:16:25,024
皆さん！ということで、本日は常闇トワ生誕祭2025にお越しくださりありがとうございます！
Everyone! Thank you so much for coming to the Tokoyami Towa Birthday Celebration 2025 today!

124
00:16:25,224 --> 00:16:30,024
常闇トワ様です！イエーイ！
It's Tokoyami Towa-sama! Yay!

125
00:16:31,524 --> 00:16:35,024
ちょっと水飲んでもいいですか？水もらっていいですか？すみません。
Can I drink some water? May I get some water? Sorry about that.

126
00:16:35,024 --> 00:16:43,024
ちょっと、すみませんね、水… あ、どこに行ってもカメラが映るのよね。
Sorry about this... Ah, no matter where I go, the camera follows me.

127
00:16:44,224 --> 00:16:46,524
水おいしい！
Water is delicious!

128
00:16:47,024 --> 00:16:54,024
ということで皆さん！今日はライブにお越しいただきありがとうございます！
So, everyone! Thank you so much for coming to the live concert today!

129
00:16:54,024 --> 00:16:58,224
3Dライブをやらせていただいております！ということで、
I'm performing a 3D live concert! And so,

130
00:16:58,224 --> 00:17:04,024
あ、早速なんですけれども、ありがとうみんな！おめでとう！ありがとう！
ah, moving right along... Thank you everyone! Happy Birthday! Thank you!

131
00:17:04,224 --> 00:17:06,524
見えてますよー！
I can see you guys!

132
00:17:06,824 --> 00:17:11,524
はい、早速なんですけれどもね、今回の配信のハッシュタグはこちら！
Alright, moving on, here is the hashtag for today's stream!

133
00:17:11,824 --> 00:17:18,824
#常闇トワ生誕祭2025 ということでね、こちらね、Xでたくさんポストしていただければなと思います！
It's #TokoyamiTowaBirthday2025, so please post a lot on X using this hashtag!

134
00:17:19,024 --> 00:17:24,024
スクリーンショットとかね、感想もいっぱいいただけたら嬉しいです。
I'd be really happy if you shared plenty of screenshots and your thoughts.

135
00:17:24,024 --> 00:17:35,524
スクショはね、もし素敵なのがあったら、ちょっとパクるというか拝借というか… 何て言うんですかね…
As for screenshots, if there are nice ones, I might borrow... or swipe them... whatever you call it...

136
00:17:36,024 --> 00:17:44,024
勝手に「これ使っちゃおう」みたいな感じで使って、後々ポストするかもしれないんですけど、そのために取っといてくれたらなと…
I might casually use them like "I'll use this!" and post them later, so I'd appreciate it if you saved good ones for that...

